WEBVTT

00:00:17.620 --> 00:00:18.540
Master!

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:19.950
Be careful!

00:00:20.330 --> 00:00:26.250
To destroy a concert is a desecration of music!

00:00:39.390 --> 00:00:41.350
<i>Ready... 1, 2, 3, GO!</i>

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:44.190
<i>Love life! Very! Very! Happy!</i>

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:46.980
<i>Friendship life! Bouncing, jumping!</i>

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:49.690
<i>Adventure life! Heart-pounding, OK?</i>

00:00:49.900 --> 00:00:52.650
<i>Song of youth! Come on ready? Let's go!</i>

00:00:52.860 --> 00:00:58.280
<i>Rushing out onto the road to</i>
<i>school with the blue sky behind us</i>

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:00.240
<i>I like that! I like this, too!</i>

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:03.750
<i>I'll take it all, all of it~</i>

00:01:03.960 --> 00:01:06.630
<i>A girl who imagines love is all romance</i>

00:01:06.830 --> 00:01:09.380
<i>If I can attack, I'll do it boldly</i>

00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:14.010
<i>Let's find an original vision for the future</i>

00:01:14.220 --> 00:01:19.930
<i>Sometimes, we'll have a secret love advice time</i>

00:01:20.140 --> 00:01:22.770
<i>Who do you like?</i>

00:01:22.980 --> 00:01:30.320
<i>You've got a green light for love now!</i>
<i>It's your chance to move forward!</i>

00:01:30.520 --> 00:01:31.150
<i>So, let's just</i>

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:34.150
<i>Have a blast! Fall in love!</i>

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:36.240
<i>Our youth is non-stop!</i>

00:01:36.450 --> 00:01:38.320
<i>Run! Aim for the future!</i>

00:01:38.530 --> 00:01:39.950
<i>Everyone gather</i>

00:01:40.160 --> 00:01:41.830
<i>For a happy ending!</i>

00:01:42.040 --> 00:01:45.370
<i>Will tomorrow be happy or sad?</i>
<i>Will we idle our time away?</i>

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:47.460
<i>We'll work hard!</i>

00:01:47.670 --> 00:01:50.750
<i>I want to keep dreaming forever!</i>

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:53.960
<i>Let's fly out into the</i>
<i>world with all our strength!</i>

00:01:54.170 --> 00:01:58.840
<i>Song of youth! Come on ready? Let's go!</i>

00:02:09.730 --> 00:02:11.150
Oh, right!

00:02:11.360 --> 00:02:14.490
I forgot to tell you all something important.

00:02:14.690 --> 00:02:16.990
I knew you would forget.

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:19.120
Tee-hee!

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:25.540
You will all be playing at next week's
Futures Indies Band concert!

00:02:26.710 --> 00:02:27.580
What?!

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:30.210
That's extreme, for real!

00:02:30.420 --> 00:02:32.460
What kind of concert is it?

00:02:32.670 --> 00:02:36.090
It's an event where up-and-coming bands
gather and have a performance competition.

00:02:36.300 --> 00:02:39.590
It's like the event was created for you guys!

00:02:39.800 --> 00:02:42.390
Do your best! It's an excellent chance!

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:43.810
Of course!

00:02:44.010 --> 00:02:45.560
I'm getting into it, for real!

00:02:45.770 --> 00:02:47.100
It sounds like a good opportunity!

00:02:47.310 --> 00:02:48.690
That's true.

00:02:48.890 --> 00:02:51.310
We'll shine the brightest, pyuru.

00:02:56.780 --> 00:03:00.450
Hey, it says the Tsurezure members
were attacked by a dark monster!

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:01.740
What?!

00:03:01.950 --> 00:03:05.790
It looks like they were saved somehow,
but Darudayu was injured.

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:08.250
Oh no, pyuru!

00:03:08.460 --> 00:03:10.830
But it doesn't seem serious...

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:13.380
Oh good, pyuru...

00:03:13.590 --> 00:03:16.550
First Trichronika, now Tsurezure?

00:03:16.760 --> 00:03:19.550
They're going after all the popular bands.

00:03:20.680 --> 00:03:23.760
Which means, we're next?!

00:03:24.970 --> 00:03:31.060
Even if that's the case, I'll kill them in an
instant with my Natural Born Crimson Knuckles!

00:03:32.400 --> 00:03:37.780
It's hard to say if the monsters would even
be able to register someone so short in stature.

00:03:37.990 --> 00:03:41.490
Huh? You want me to try them out on you first?!

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:49.750
Speaking of which, when we first met,
you drove off a dark monster, didn't you, Cyan?

00:03:50.920 --> 00:03:54.420
Um, that was...

00:03:54.630 --> 00:03:57.630
I kind of got caught up in it without
really knowing what was going on...

00:03:57.840 --> 00:03:59.550
You got caught up in it?

00:03:59.760 --> 00:04:02.300
Y-Yeah...

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:04.890
Is that what happened?

00:04:05.100 --> 00:04:07.470
That's not how it looked, though...

00:04:14.770 --> 00:04:18.860
For the next concert,
I really wanted to play a new song,

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:21.990
but no matter how you look at it,
we don't have enough time.

00:04:22.200 --> 00:04:25.070
That's true. We only have about ten days left.

00:04:25.280 --> 00:04:29.080
Cyan, will you think about a new arrangement
for one of our songs with me again?

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:32.120
Sure! Sounds good.

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:37.040
Well, good night. See you tomorrow!

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:38.090
'Night.

00:04:38.300 --> 00:04:40.340
'Night, pyuru!

00:04:40.550 --> 00:04:42.260
Good night!

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:45.720
Cyan!

00:04:47.100 --> 00:04:52.600
I thought I'd look into the
dark monsters a little more...

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:56.770
If you're curious, too,
you can do research with me...

00:04:56.980 --> 00:04:58.730
Really? I can?

00:05:00.690 --> 00:05:02.320
What is this...?

00:05:02.530 --> 00:05:04.150
It's my computer.

00:05:04.360 --> 00:05:08.120
But... You can use all of these functions?

00:05:10.240 --> 00:05:13.250
Wow... You're using all of them.

00:05:13.460 --> 00:05:17.170
We can see what's going
on at different venues here.

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:21.550
Too bad. No one's playing tonight.

00:05:21.760 --> 00:05:23.590
You can see a bunch of interesting bands here.

00:05:23.800 --> 00:05:25.130
Really?

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:27.890
And here's the hits chart.

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:29.930
Trichon, Tsurezure—

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:31.970
Oh, Criticrista!

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:35.980
Yeah, they are getting really popular lately...

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:37.860
Even though they're just middle schoolers.

00:05:39.110 --> 00:05:41.570
These are threads to discuss the latest bands.

00:05:41.780 --> 00:05:43.030
Really?

00:05:43.240 --> 00:05:45.610
Oh, right, there was something
written about you, too, Cyan.

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:47.360
What? Me?

00:05:47.570 --> 00:05:53.370
Look, here. "The girl who defeated the
dark monster during Trichronika's concert

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:56.330
looks exactly like
Plasmagica's new member, Cyan.

00:05:56.540 --> 00:06:00.710
Her performance was really cool,
and her guitar solo was the best!"

00:06:00.920 --> 00:06:02.550
That's what it says.

00:06:02.920 --> 00:06:06.720
Wow, there it is! That makes me happy!

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:12.100
But you really were amazing that time, Cyan.

00:06:12.310 --> 00:06:15.730
Really? You think so, meow?
Oh, I did it again...

00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:24.780
I always start talking funny
when I get excited...

00:06:27.400 --> 00:06:28.700
It's fine, isn't it?

00:06:30.700 --> 00:06:34.120
Cyan, saying "meow" is all right.

00:06:34.330 --> 00:06:38.500
You could use it during the talk
part of our performances. I think.

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:40.960
Y-You think so?

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:45.420
Yeah.

00:06:46.380 --> 00:06:48.720
Retoree? What's wrong?

00:06:56.350 --> 00:07:00.350
Oh, right! I have some limited
edition snacks! You can eat some!

00:07:00.560 --> 00:07:03.020
Really? What?

00:07:03.230 --> 00:07:08.030
Strawberry Choi-Pies, strawberry-flavored
Pochy, and strawberry chips, and—

00:07:08.240 --> 00:07:12.870
Wow, they look delicious! I love strawberries!

00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:18.370
Hey, can we watch music videos on this, too?

00:07:18.580 --> 00:07:21.080
Oh, we can use Superbia for that...

00:07:21.290 --> 00:07:22.580
Superbia?

00:07:25.800 --> 00:07:32.510
Grateful King. Really,
I am tired of your stubbornness.

00:07:32.720 --> 00:07:34.560
Thanks for the compliment.

00:07:34.760 --> 00:07:39.060
However, I must have you write a song soon.

00:07:39.270 --> 00:07:44.060
Your attitude is resulting
in bad things for Midi City.

00:07:44.270 --> 00:07:46.860
Oh? Bad things, huh?

00:07:47.320 --> 00:07:51.320
Like you'll have an off-season
Halloween or Christmas or something?

00:07:51.530 --> 00:07:55.370
I'm sure the Myumons who like
festivals will be happy about that.

00:07:55.580 --> 00:07:59.710
I'm about done listening to your nonsense.

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:01.210
Dagger, sir.

00:08:01.420 --> 00:08:02.460
What is it?

00:08:02.670 --> 00:08:09.300
Regarding the Tsurezure incident...
Um, I... I couldn't get them!

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:12.180
Didn't I say you wouldn't get another chance?

00:08:12.380 --> 00:08:14.930
I'm sorry! Next time, I will definitely—

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:22.140
I will also need to get serious soon.

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:32.400
Master, how is your injury?

00:08:33.360 --> 00:08:35.870
There is no need for worry.

00:08:36.070 --> 00:08:40.290
Even if you say that,
please do not push yourself too hard.

00:08:40.500 --> 00:08:45.330
However, who was behind that apparition?

00:08:47.170 --> 00:08:54.260
If the world were a single road...

00:08:54.470 --> 00:09:01.390
A straight, safe path will one day
become boring to those who walk upon it.

00:09:02.520 --> 00:09:09.690
When that happens, people will want to
walk on an uneven path with twists and turns.

00:09:11.780 --> 00:09:16.410
Evil lurks in the bends of that path.

00:09:16.620 --> 00:09:21.250
For that same reason,
monsters are appearing in Midi City.

00:09:21.450 --> 00:09:23.580
In other words—

00:09:24.040 --> 00:09:26.250
After peace continues for hundreds of years,

00:09:26.460 --> 00:09:29.670
someone will always appear
who will destroy that peace.

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:32.420
That is how the world works.

00:09:33.090 --> 00:09:38.800
Master, you speak as if you
have seen it with your own eyes.

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:43.640
Of course not. It is just what I was told.

00:09:46.400 --> 00:09:50.940
That girl... Will good
fortune befall her, or bad...?

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:55.900
Oh, that was fun!

00:09:56.110 --> 00:09:59.280
Retoree likes to talk more than I expected.

00:10:00.580 --> 00:10:02.040
Hey!

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:05.040
You don't have time to play around!

00:10:05.250 --> 00:10:06.830
Hurry up and practice your guitar!

00:10:07.040 --> 00:10:09.920
Why are you so aggressive all of a sudden?

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:12.460
Did you forget your mission?

00:10:12.670 --> 00:10:15.590
Mission...? Meow?

00:10:15.800 --> 00:10:20.100
Come on! Don't tell me you forgot
what you came to this world for?

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:24.730
Um, I have to beat the bad monsters, right?

00:10:24.930 --> 00:10:28.150
Right! In order to do that,
you have to raise your music skill.

00:10:28.350 --> 00:10:30.360
I-I know that.

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:35.190
I've been working hard with
the girls in the band to do that.

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:37.110
That's not enough!

00:10:37.610 --> 00:10:41.830
Practice first! Practice second!
Practice third and fourth!

00:10:42.030 --> 00:10:47.000
- I feel like you're really impatient today, Mr. Berry.
- What? A man? Who?

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:53.170
Then, if another dark monster
appears somewhere, I have to go fight it?

00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:54.880
That's how it is.

00:10:55.090 --> 00:10:59.180
That's a lot of responsibility... Can I do it?

00:10:59.380 --> 00:11:02.350
That's why I'm telling you to practice!

00:11:02.550 --> 00:11:05.810
But, isn't it kind of sudden?

00:11:06.020 --> 00:11:09.440
That is how urgent the situation has become.

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:12.190
Besides, don't you want to hurry up
and go back to your world?

00:11:12.400 --> 00:11:17.070
Huh? Th-That's true, but...

00:11:17.280 --> 00:11:19.200
What's wrong? You don't look too happy about it.

00:11:19.400 --> 00:11:23.700
Huh? R-Really? That's not true. Really!

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:28.370
Anyway, I'll make sure
to fulfill my mission properly.

00:11:28.580 --> 00:11:33.250
- All right, as long as you get it!
- She's talking to her guitar? That's not possible...!

00:11:39.130 --> 00:11:44.180
Then, if another dark monster
appears somewhere, I have to go fight it?

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:48.310
Besides, don't you want to hurry up
and go back to your world?

00:11:49.770 --> 00:11:51.600
What is the meaning of this?

00:11:52.310 --> 00:11:54.060
Where did you live until now, pyuru?

00:11:54.270 --> 00:11:55.360
Huh?

00:11:55.570 --> 00:11:58.030
In a bunch of places... I moved a lot...

00:11:58.240 --> 00:11:59.900
Running away from home?

00:12:00.110 --> 00:12:01.910
Criti... crista...

00:12:02.110 --> 00:12:06.740
It says they're students
at St. Midi Girls' Academy.

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:08.700
Is that a big deal?

00:12:08.910 --> 00:12:11.120
Cyan, you've never heard of it?

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:14.630
It's "Tsurezurenaru Ayatsuri Mugenan," Cyan!

00:12:14.840 --> 00:12:16.250
"Tsurezure"?

00:12:16.460 --> 00:12:20.630
Now that I think about it,
there were a lot of strange things...

00:12:20.840 --> 00:12:25.140
No, I have to ask her about it directly first!

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:30.230
That was pretty good!

00:12:30.430 --> 00:12:31.640
No mistakes today, either.

00:12:31.850 --> 00:12:33.150
Perfect, pyuru!

00:12:33.350 --> 00:12:35.560
Th-That's right.

00:12:38.230 --> 00:12:41.780
Oh, Chuchu, about the arrangement
you were talking about before—

00:12:41.990 --> 00:12:43.360
Y-Yes?

00:12:44.610 --> 00:12:45.990
Is something wrong?

00:12:46.200 --> 00:12:49.200
Oh no, nothing's wrong...

00:12:50.250 --> 00:12:53.500
How am I supposed to bring it up?

00:12:56.170 --> 00:13:01.550
If it's true, how can she act so normal?

00:13:01.760 --> 00:13:05.680
No matter what,
I have to talk this over with her.

00:13:09.100 --> 00:13:10.430
Um, Cyan—

00:13:10.640 --> 00:13:16.060
Oi, you guys! I have the ultimate final idea!

00:13:16.270 --> 00:13:18.820
What do you think about selling
tons of merch at our next concert

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:21.610
to fulfill the desires of the cattle?

00:13:21.820 --> 00:13:23.490
Merch?

00:13:24.070 --> 00:13:26.780
Sorry, Chuchu. What were you saying?

00:13:26.990 --> 00:13:30.120
Never mind, it's nothing.

00:13:33.870 --> 00:13:38.340
Is the situation more serious than we thought?

00:13:39.670 --> 00:13:42.010
But what can we do...?

00:13:51.010 --> 00:13:52.850
Oh, this is it.

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:55.850
"Shizuku Secret Mind"?

00:13:56.060 --> 00:13:58.310
It looks like we're sharing a room.

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:03.530
Splash, splash!

00:14:05.280 --> 00:14:07.820
It's cold!

00:14:08.030 --> 00:14:09.030
Splash, splash!

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:10.080
Um...

00:14:11.280 --> 00:14:14.000
Oh, are you girls Plasmagica?

00:14:14.200 --> 00:14:18.000
I'm Corriente from Shizuku Secret Mind.

00:14:18.210 --> 00:14:20.420
I'm Wendy, from the same band.

00:14:20.630 --> 00:14:23.920
W-We look forward to working with you today.

00:14:24.510 --> 00:14:27.010
You can have this if you'd like.

00:14:27.220 --> 00:14:29.680
"Too Delicious Water"?

00:14:30.680 --> 00:14:34.350
We always buy it cheap with our
employee discount and bring it with us.

00:14:34.560 --> 00:14:35.640
Employee?

00:14:35.850 --> 00:14:39.150
You're working and in a band at the same time?

00:14:39.350 --> 00:14:43.360
We're from the city of water, Venicillin.

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:48.570
Anyway, because of our water connections,
we sell mineral water part-time.

00:14:48.780 --> 00:14:49.530
Really...?

00:14:49.740 --> 00:14:53.700
Corriente's number one in sales!

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:54.870
That's amazing!

00:14:55.080 --> 00:14:57.710
Not really...

00:14:57.910 --> 00:15:02.000
Do you ever feel lonely
living far away from your home?

00:15:02.210 --> 00:15:06.920
Yeah. But all four of us in the
band are classmates from music school,

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:10.890
and we're always together,
so I don't feel lonely much.

00:15:11.090 --> 00:15:12.470
Is that right?

00:15:12.680 --> 00:15:15.350
It must be reassuring to have friends around.

00:15:15.770 --> 00:15:19.770
Oh? Where are the other members?

00:15:19.980 --> 00:15:24.480
Oh, Shabobon and
Turtle aren't done with work yet.

00:15:24.690 --> 00:15:26.570
They'll rush over when they're finished.

00:15:26.780 --> 00:15:28.400
I see, pyuru!

00:15:29.910 --> 00:15:36.040
By the way, have you heard?
There's a strange rumor going around recently.

00:15:36.240 --> 00:15:37.200
Rumor?

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:43.170
The rumor about band members
that have been disappearing suddenly.

00:15:43.880 --> 00:15:47.960
Without warning... Snap, and they're gone.

00:15:48.170 --> 00:15:50.680
Do you mean... they've gone missing?

00:15:50.880 --> 00:15:51.510
That's right!

00:15:51.720 --> 00:15:53.680
That's scary, pyuru!

00:15:53.890 --> 00:16:00.310
On top of that, you know that popular bands
are getting attacked one after another, right?

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:05.150
People have been saying
that the incidents are related.

00:16:05.360 --> 00:16:08.360
When that happened, the one who
defeated the monster was actually—

00:16:08.570 --> 00:16:12.320
Well, even from the major labels,
only the popular bands are getting targeted,

00:16:12.530 --> 00:16:14.620
so I don't think they'll show up here.

00:16:14.820 --> 00:16:19.040
It'd be nice for both our bands to
be popular enough to be targeted.

00:16:19.250 --> 00:16:21.000
Right?

00:16:25.340 --> 00:16:27.710
Let's go, you cattle!

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:31.010
Crow! Ship us out!

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:46.730
♪ Cruelly shining, the worst stigma ♪

00:16:46.940 --> 00:16:49.070
It looks like it's started, pyuru!

00:16:49.280 --> 00:16:51.110
Chuchu, do you want to practice a little?

00:16:51.320 --> 00:16:53.860
Uh, yeah! That's a good idea...

00:16:54.070 --> 00:16:55.530
Breaking news—

00:16:55.740 --> 00:17:02.080
A dark monster has appeared
during the Ninjinriot concert at S-River.

00:17:02.290 --> 00:17:04.670
- We have no further details at this moment,
- Again?!

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:08.340
but the concert was interrupted
and the venue is in a state of panic.

00:17:08.550 --> 00:17:12.130
We will provide an update
once we receive new information.

00:17:12.340 --> 00:17:15.140
What? I have to go no matter what?

00:17:15.340 --> 00:17:19.140
I told you! Your mission is
to exterminate the dark monsters.

00:17:19.350 --> 00:17:22.270
But I'm about to perform!

00:17:22.480 --> 00:17:24.060
What'll I tell everyone?

00:17:24.270 --> 00:17:26.190
You don't have time to be indecisive.

00:17:26.400 --> 00:17:27.150
Come on, hurry!

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:31.570
But... I can't do this... I mean...

00:17:31.780 --> 00:17:33.570
Listen carefully, Cyan!

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:37.450
I know very well that the
band is important to you.

00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:41.540
But this world is in a huge crisis right now.

00:17:41.750 --> 00:17:44.500
You're the only one who can save the world.

00:17:44.710 --> 00:17:47.630
I know, but... But...

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:49.670
If you know, then hurry up and go!

00:17:49.960 --> 00:17:50.920
Come on, run!

00:17:51.130 --> 00:17:52.630
Where are you going?

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:56.130
Chuchu...

00:17:56.340 --> 00:17:58.510
Will you explain what's going on?

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:01.720
Um, I...

00:18:01.930 --> 00:18:05.600
Are you going to fight the
monster that appeared at S-River?

00:18:06.390 --> 00:18:09.480
What about our concert?
What'll you do about that?

00:18:11.230 --> 00:18:14.320
Cyan, what are you hiding?

00:18:15.650 --> 00:18:19.740
Chuchu, I... I...

00:18:21.450 --> 00:18:24.450
Chuchu, talk later! Let her go for now!

00:18:25.080 --> 00:18:27.000
Your guitar really <i>is</i> talking!

00:18:27.210 --> 00:18:28.460
Hurry, Cyan!

00:18:29.540 --> 00:18:31.840
Sorry, Chuchu! I'll be right back!

00:18:32.050 --> 00:18:34.170
Wait a minute! Cyan!

00:18:36.760 --> 00:18:38.130
Sorry, everyone!

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:40.510
I promise I'll be back before we perform!

00:18:55.990 --> 00:18:57.780
We've gotta hurry!

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:13.960
Were we too late?

00:19:14.170 --> 00:19:17.970
The members of Ninjinriot got away somehow.

00:19:18.170 --> 00:19:20.140
I'm so glad...

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:28.730
Hey, Mr. Berry... Don't tell me the
monster is heading for Plasmagica...

00:19:28.940 --> 00:19:30.350
Huh?

00:19:30.560 --> 00:19:31.980
I have to go back!

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:39.700
Please, don't let the
monster be where Plasmagica is.

00:19:41.070 --> 00:19:43.700
Once I know they're okay,

00:19:43.910 --> 00:19:47.200
I'll explain everything to them properly!

00:19:47.410 --> 00:19:50.120
I finally found a band that understands me.

00:19:50.330 --> 00:19:51.670
I don't want to ruin that!

00:20:01.800 --> 00:20:05.970
Oh, good... It doesn't
look like it came this way...

00:20:06.180 --> 00:20:10.600
But I didn't make it in time...
The concert's over...

00:20:17.530 --> 00:20:18.780
Everyone...

00:20:20.650 --> 00:20:24.700
I made all the cattle knock on
heaven's door with my voice today, too!

00:20:25.740 --> 00:20:26.780
Woah, you little—

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:29.790
Where did you run off to,
leaving the concert like that?

00:20:30.000 --> 00:20:31.290
Crow.

00:20:34.500 --> 00:20:38.460
Cyan, can you explain?

00:20:40.130 --> 00:20:45.850
Th-There's something I haven't told you...

00:20:50.140 --> 00:20:56.650
Actually, the day I met you all,
I had been brought from another world...

00:20:56.860 --> 00:20:58.270
Another world?

00:20:58.900 --> 00:21:00.740
Huh?

00:21:00.940 --> 00:21:04.110
You mean, you are not from this world?

00:21:07.780 --> 00:21:11.580
Then... Then you have to go back someday?

00:21:13.460 --> 00:21:16.750
That's...

00:21:16.960 --> 00:21:23.630
I'm really sorry that I couldn't tell you...
that I hid it from you all this time...

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:28.260
Being apologized to just makes it worse...

00:21:28.600 --> 00:21:32.100
Being told that after all
this time makes it worse!

00:21:33.390 --> 00:21:34.480
Retoree!

00:21:36.190 --> 00:21:38.060
Retoree...

00:21:44.700 --> 00:21:45.860
Oh?

00:21:47.280 --> 00:21:48.910
What's the matter?

00:22:00.840 --> 00:22:04.010
<i>If you like it, I'm sure you can do it</i>

00:22:04.220 --> 00:22:06.880
<i>You can do it because you like it</i>

00:22:07.090 --> 00:22:09.600
<i>The feeling that you like music</i>

00:22:09.800 --> 00:22:12.970
<i>Can't be stopped by anyone</i>

00:22:13.180 --> 00:22:21.400
<i>GO GO LUCKY Have a nice MUSIC!!</i>

00:22:21.610 --> 00:22:23.610
<i>GO GO HAPPY MUSIC!!</i>

00:22:24.570 --> 00:22:27.160
<i>Running through my body</i>

00:22:27.360 --> 00:22:29.700
<i>This electric thrill</i>

00:22:29.910 --> 00:22:34.700
<i>Is this feeling curiosity?</i>

00:22:35.830 --> 00:22:38.250
<i>Negativity is a decrescendo</i>

00:22:38.460 --> 00:22:40.920
<i>Hope and expectations, a crescendo</i>

00:22:41.130 --> 00:22:46.470
<i>Show off our passion and</i>
<i>get god to be our ally, too</i>

00:22:46.670 --> 00:22:51.970
<i>I wanna share with everyone and have a taste of</i>

00:22:52.180 --> 00:22:55.680
<i>Big!! Rocking!! Heart-throbbing!! Happiness!!!!</i>

00:22:56.680 --> 00:22:59.730
<i>If it's you, I'm sure you can do it</i>

00:22:59.940 --> 00:23:02.730
<i>You can do it because it's you</i>

00:23:02.940 --> 00:23:07.820
<i>Let's try performing these</i>
<i>dream-colored notes together</i>

00:23:08.030 --> 00:23:11.030
<i>I want to tell you directly</i>

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:13.870
<i>A life-sized, "heart-sized" heart</i>

00:23:14.080 --> 00:23:16.750
<i>In order for it to reach you...</i>

00:23:16.950 --> 00:23:20.080
<i>I will sing with all I have</i>

00:23:20.290 --> 00:23:22.840
<i>GO GO LUCKY Have a nice MUSIC!!</i>

00:23:23.040 --> 00:23:24.800
<i>GO GO HAPPY MUSIC!!</i>

00:23:26.800 --> 00:23:29.220
Will Plasmagica be all right?

00:23:29.430 --> 00:23:32.430
What doesn't kill us makes us stronger.
There is a calm after the storm.

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:35.260
Life has its camels and spiders.
All's well that ends well!

00:23:35.470 --> 00:23:40.690
Prez, I can't tell if you're broad-minded
or just empty-headed sometimes.
